   "registered_protocol": "the registered 0.5-a0 boundary needs max e_N >= 0.50; measured max e_N = 0.1931 (BELOW) -- the survey-pair axis (0.193, genuine close pairs) edges out the 2M++/MCXC maxclu axis (0.119, G044), but BOTH stay below the 0.3 level",
